    "breadcrumb": "Swing Catalyst Support \u003e Software \u0026 Funktionen",
    "content": "Dieser Artikel zeigt, wie Sie Aufnahmen aus Swing Catalyst / Motion Catalyst exportieren.\nAufnahmen exportieren Aufnahmen können auf verschiedene Weise exportiert werden – entweder aus dem Stack oder direkt aus dem Explorer. Funktional gibt es keinen Unterschied zwischen ihnen.\nExportieren aus dem Stack Exporting from the Explorer Recordings can be exported from the explorer by dragging a recording to the export list (see below screenshot) or by right clicking the recording and selecting from the available export options.\nThe Explorer Export list Export options Exporting as a take file (the default option) will allow the recording to be imported by other Swing Catalyst or Motion Catalyst users. All of the data collected with the recording is stored with the take file.\nIf you wish to export just the video file(s) select “Video only”. Note if you have multiple cameras this will export each angle as a separate video file.\nFor details on the raw data option please see our raw data article.\nLast updated: 2023-12-19 | View on official support site",
